🌐 https://space.marsit.uz/ — Quiz

🛠 https://www.typing.com — asosiy mashq platformasi (bepul, Google bilan kirish)

🛠 https://www.ratatype.com — alternativa, sertifikat oluvchi

🛠 https://monkeytype.com — kattalar uchun, lekin bolalar ham o'ynay oladi

