⚠️ Leonardo Free hisobida 150 token/kun — sinf uchun yetarli, lekin reja bilan.

⚠️ Photoroom Free hisob barcha rasmlar uchun ishlaydi.

⚠️ Scratch fayl yuklash limit — 10 MB. PNG sifati eng yaxshi.

