6. Asosiy logika (50–105 daq)

 

   Bola (Sprite 1):

   • Variables: vy (velocity y), vx (velocity x)

   • when green flag clicked:

   - go to start position (chapda)

   - set vy to 0

   - set vx to 0

   • forever:

   # Klaviatura kontroli

   - if right arrow pressed → set vx to 5

   - if left arrow pressed → set vx to -5

   - if not (right or left) → set vx to 0

   # Gravity

   - change y by vy

   - change vy by -1

   # Platform collision (yer va platformalar yashil rangda)

   - if touching color [GREEN]:

   - change y by 1 (back up)

   - set vy to 0 # to'xtaydi

   # Sakrash (faqat yerda turganda)

   - if space pressed and (touching color [GREEN]):

   - set vy to 12

   # X harakat

   - change x by vx

   - if touching color [BLACK] (devor):

   - change x by -vx (back up)

 

   Coins (Sprite 2):

   • Clone yoki duplicate 5 marta

   • forever: if touching player → change Score by 10 → hide

 

   Dushman (Sprite 3, ixtiyoriy):

   • forever: glide 2 sec to random

   • if touching player → say «Game Over!» → stop all

 

   Final flag (Sprite 4):

   • if touching player → say «You Win!» → stop all

 

