Dars ketma-ketligi

0 daqiqa

1. Salomlashish va vovlechenie (0–5 daq)

   • «Bugun siz tanlaydi! Bu sizning final o'yiningiz!»

   • Mentor 3 ta variantni qisqa demonstrate qiladi (har biri 1 daq)

 

2. Core'da davomat (5–10 daq)

   • https://core.marsit.uz/ — davomat

   • Kelmaganlarga Telegram

 

3. Oldingi dars takrori (10–15 daq)

   • Q&A: «Tank Battle'da clone qanday ishladi?» — 2-3 coin

 

4. 3 ta variantni taqdim qilish (15–25 daq)

   • Mentor doskaga 3 ta o'yin yozadi va qisqa tushuntiradi:

   - Space Invaders: jang, alien'lar, score

   - Quiz Game: savol-javob, ball

   - Racing: avtomobil, tezlik, obstakl

   • Bola tanlaydi va mavzu individuallashtirish (mas, alien'lar — Mars'dan, savollar — Mars IT haqida, avtomobil — Toshkent'da)

 

5. Tanlangan o'yin amaliy mashq (25–105 daq)

 

   AGAR Space Invaders:

   • Sprite 1: Spaceship (player) — pastda yuradi (chap-o'ng)

   • Sprite 2: Alien (3 qator x 5 ta = 15) — clones

   • Sprite 3: Bullet — clones

   • Logic:

   - Aliens: forever move 2, when at edge change y by -10 + reverse

   - Spaceship: arrow keys harakat, space → bullet

   - Bullet: move up, if touch alien → both delete + score

   - Game over: alien touches bottom

 

   AGAR Quiz Game:

   • Variables: Score, Question (number)

   • Stage:

   - List: Questions [10 ta savol]

   - List: Answers [10 ta javob]

   • Bola sprite savol beradi:

   - ask Questions[Question] and wait

   - if answer = Answers[Question] → change Score by 10 + say «To'g'ri!»

   - else → say «Noto'g'ri, javob: Answers[Question]»

   - change Question by 1

   • Final: when Question = 10 → say «Yakun! Sizning ballingiz: [Score]/100»

 

   AGAR Racing:

   • Sprite 1: Car — pastda, chap-o'ng (X koordinata)

   • Background: Yo'l (chizilgan yoki AI)

   • Sprite 2: Obstakl — yuqoridan tushadi (clones)

   • Logic:

   - Car: arrow keys X, lekin yo'l ichida qolish

   - Obstakl: clone, gliding pastga, if touching car → game over

   - Score: timer (vaqt)

   - Tezlik: har 10 sec — obstakl tezligi oshadi

 

   Mentor 90 daq davomida har bolaga 1-2 daq yordam beradi

   Bola «o'zining» versiyasini yaratadi (custom theme, custom sprite)

 

6. Polishing (105–115 daq)

   • Welcome screen («Bos yashil bayroq»)

   • Game over screen

   • Ovozlar (sound effects)

   • Score display

   • Background music (Sound bloki)

 

7. Coin'lar va guruhga ko'rsatish (115–117 daq)

   • Har bola final o'yinini guruhga ko'rsatadi

   • Mentor o'ynaydi

   • Eng yaxshilarga 20-25 coin

   • Qolganlarga 15-20 coin

 

8. Yakun va uyga vazifa (117–119 daq)

   • Loyiha link Telegram'da

   • Uyga vazifa

   • 🧪 «https://space.marsit.uz/ — 11-oy yakuniy Quiz!»

 

9. Quvnoq xayrlashish (119–120 daq)

   • «11-oy tugadi! 🎮 Keyingi oy — final oy! Yulduz bo'lasiz!»

